        "category": "İnceleme-Soruşturma",
        "html": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 1px solid #ccc;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>T.C.</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>GENÇLİK VE SPOR BAKANLIĞI</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Rehberlik ve Denetim Başkanlığı</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><p><strong>ARŞİV NO:</strong></p><p><strong>Rapor Sayısı: XX.##/2024 - #</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong>İNCELEME/SORUŞTURMA </strong><strong>RAPORU</strong></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 1px solid #ccc;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>ONAY</strong></p><p>ONAY TARİHİ: </p><p>ONAY SAYISI: </p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>GÖREV EMRİ </strong></p><p>TARİHİ: </p><p>SAYISI: </p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>RAPOR</strong></p><p>SAYFA ADEDİ:  </p><p>EK ADEDİ:          … adet … sayfa</p></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;\"><p>                    ………….                            ………..</p><p>                   Başmüfettiş                  Müfettiş/Müfettiş Yrd. </p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>ONAY</strong></p><p>ONAY TARİHİ: </p><p>ONAY SAYISI: </p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>GÖREV EMRİ </strong></p><p>TARİHİ: </p><p>SAYISI: </p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>RAPOR</strong></p><p>SAYFA ADEDİ:  </p><p>EK ADEDİ:          … adet … sayfa</p></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;\"><p><strong>İlgili Birim:</strong> …. Başkanlığı/ .... İl Müdürlüğü/ .… Yurt Müdürlüğü/ …. Kulübü</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>ONAY</strong></p><p>ONAY TARİHİ: </p><p>ONAY SAYISI: </p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>GÖREV EMRİ </strong></p><p>TARİHİ: </p><p>SAYISI: </p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>RAPOR</strong></p><p>SAYFA ADEDİ:  </p><p>EK ADEDİ:          … adet … sayfa</p></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong>Konu:</strong> </p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>…/</strong><strong>….</strong><strong>/2024</strong></p><p><strong>\t</strong><strong>\t</strong><strong>\t</strong><strong>\t</strong><strong>\t</strong><strong>\t</strong><strong>\t</strong><strong>\t</strong><strong>\t ANKARA</strong></p><p>Açıklama:</p><p>XX \tAd-Soyad Başharfleri</p><p>(##)\tMühür Numarası</p><p>(#) \tRapor Sayısı</p>"
